								Posts: 14355<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/macross.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								My Avatar can beat up your avatar!<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/kinladar@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="kinladar@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org" title="http://www.rodcetnife.org" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:truman@thewavz.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1096.msg10819#msg10819"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1096.msg10819#msg10819">Re: FoT stealing  guild passwords </a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #16 on:</b> September 05, 2004, 02:26:54 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							And just for the record, and for any guild leader who reads this, if an anonymous poster does flame, post logs/board threads etc... I am willing to share IP information with you, as I have done for some guilds already.<br /><br />I don&#039;t like anon posters, and while I will not post your IP address publicly, I will share it with the guild you copied your shit from, or anonymously flamed if they request it.<br /><br />If I wanna flame someone, I&#039;ll do it to thier damned face. That is one of the major things I can never take away from Grem, he&#039;s never hid who he is, or what guild he was from. <br /><br />Also, no danger of this thread getting deleted Shib, I&#039;ve restored some threads from the trash that were removed in the past, Rants and Raves will not have threads deleted, but you better have the balls to face up to your real name.<br /><br />Rants and Raves is unmoderated, and only thing that would get changed would be something that would leave me as an indivual in a liable position (IE had to go to court over some fuck tard posting kiddie porn links or some shit)
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
