							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							haha, o wow <br />Ok first i want to say that musicman was not me ... If i have something to say i will say it , i have no problems with speaking my mind on a topic. Musicman is my roomate that is a fucking retard and will never play eq or use my com again. I have many friends in fot and wouldn&#039;t talk shit about a whole guild about something as stupid as this. I apologize on his behalf and send a personal apology to soltrack and kinladar ( these were names named by music) Although&nbsp; this piece of shit probably&nbsp; ruined all my relationships with any and all fot members. I jus want u to know that i could give a rats ass about what happened. Shit i thought it was funnie , so if anyone has a problem with any thread he made / makes send a tell to shib in game and ill handle it .<br /><br />btw kin,&nbsp; u scared him&nbsp; by telling him u knew who he was lol... good stuff 
