	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10840"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=570" title="View the profile of Castamist">Castamist</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 39<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=4859621" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=4859621&amp;img=5" alt="4859621" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=570"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:castamist@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1096.msg10840#msg10840"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1096.msg10840#msg10840">Re: FoT stealing  guild passwords </a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #26 on:</b> September 05, 2004, 07:41:51 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							A previous post mentioned an applicant of Ascent mistelling the channel password in a populated area.  So I don&#039;t think the password was leaked to hurt Ascent.. sometimes shit happens and we all make mistakes. (autojoin or hotkey it, noob /wink)  Phoebie might&#039;ve told me the password is ancient and  I&#039;ve seen a couple of Ascent apps have the password but change their minds on what road they were taking and no longer be Ascent apps.   I didn&#039;t see  the password changed then either. LOL- actually, after FoT&#039;s invasion to FoA, the password was same.   It might be changed now or will be, but I think Ascent couldn&#039;t be bothered getting all bent out of shape about it and they just blew it off.<br /><br />My chat channels went down 3 times that raid so I wasn&#039;t in the channel when this happened. I got a red text message saying I&#039;d lost connection with the channels.. yadda yadda yadda, and if anyone knows anything about this, Please PM me. It was the suck!  <br /><br />Hearing about the channel invasion did give me a bad taste in my mouth.  Knowing NO history on the seeminly ongoing channel invasions,   I felt it sneaky and even morally wrong to join the channel and spy when not invited.  That same raid someobody had offered the FoT channel password so we could retaliate.  Nobody wanted to bother.  <br /><br />Oh well. It was about a 2 on the drama scale, ehe?  And really, if anyone has any clue why the hell my chat channels have been disconnecting on me.. and unable to rejoin without camping or zoning.. please PM me.  Three disconnects in one day is frustrating as hell.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Castamist - 65 Archon - RN
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
